Cell["\<\
The resulting association uses representation Dynkin coefficients for its \
keys with multiplicities of the representation in the product as values.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2123714548,ExpressionUUID->"b90689c1-ac86-4beb-a87e-123350782e8d"],

