Dynkin coefficients of the highest weight in the representation.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1780800353,ExpressionUUID->"5c420144-3194-425b-8167-eeef21fd232a"]
}, Dynamic[CurrentValue[
 EvaluationNotebook[], {TaggingRules, "Openers", "NotesSection"}, Closed]]]],

